<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="1d19ade0">&lt;p&gt;
    Using the projected future operating costs, the current baseline, and the program plan showing when
    capabilities/enablers are being deployed, financial benefits should be calculated within a spreadsheet model. This
    should take into consideration the phasing of implementation activities.&amp;nbsp;For example, the deployment of an IT
    system may be spread over a 12 month time period. It can be beneficial to consider a worst case/best case/most likely
    set of estimates. Prioritized non-financial benefits should also be quantified based on the projected implementation
    timescales and the existing baseline.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
